{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2022-12-07 16:18:00', 'title': 'NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS, LP ANNOUNCES OFFERING OF $500 MILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2026', 'text': 'JUNO BEACH, FLA. , DEC. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS, LP (NYSE: NEP) TODAY ANNOUNCED AN OFFERING OF $500 MILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2026 (THE "NOTES") IN A PRIVATE PLACEMENT TO QUALIFIED INSTITUTIONAL BUYERS PURSUANT TO RULE 144A UNDER THE SECURITIES ACT OF 1933, AS AMENDED (THE "SECURITIES ACT").'}